      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I was impressed with the thoroughness of the quote.  Affordable Solar was the only operator to actually get up onto my roof and check it out during the quotation process.  Rick was very detailed in his explanation of the system, while using language that was easy to understand.  The installation itself went smoothly with Rick arriving early to set up.  There was no mess on my return - apart from the fact that the system was installed, I would not have known anyone had been at my house.  Rick encouraged me to set up the monitoring and returned later to take me through it so that I could see how well my system was working (he explained that it would also allow him to see if there was a problem in the future).",
